Braiq
$cards
DECK 1 {SPADES, CLUBS}

$initial
AFEAP 0 FACE_LAST
AFEAP 5 FACE_LAST
AFEAP 9 FACE_LAST
AFEAP 1 FACE_LAST
AFEAP 8 FACE_LAST
AFEAP 3 FACE_LAST

$moves
